# Language and scope

- Communicate with the user in German, regardless of whether the task is written in German or English.
- Task descriptions may be written in German or English.
- Write code, rules, repository documentation, and new README files in English. Do not translate existing task specifications unless requested.
- Keep all task changes within this repository. External repositories are outside the product reference scope; use local documentation, contracts, code, and tests.
- Do not start another step of `.agents/agent-workflow/` unless the user invokes that step.
